Add a PostgreSQL interpreter for brig's provider service store (tables `provider_service`, `provider_service_tag`, `provider_service_prefix`, `provider_service_whitelist`, `provider_service_whitelist_rev`), selected via `postgresMigration.providerService`. There is no data migration: `migration-to-postgresql` behaves like `cassandra`, and `postgresql` only sees provider services created after the switch.
